									<p class="metasyncPara"> Designers consider site orientation, existing vegetation, and outdoor <b>lighting</b> to plan how the <b>water</b> feature interacts with patios, gardens, and pool areas. Research by the <b>Landscape</b> Institute (2022) illustrates that outdoor installations that integrate <b>water</b> elements can improve ambient relaxation and outdoor enjoyment by up to 28%. </p>								</div>
